/-- ★★★★ シート行310 `R296 (2,2,0)(3,3,1) = psi(W_w + psi_2(W_w))`。 -/
theorem R310_mem : R296 ++ [((2, 2, 0) : ℕ × ℕ × ℕ), ((3, 3, 1) : ℕ × ℕ × ℕ)] ∈ W 0 := by
